<item>
            <title>[LU-20155] improve lfs_setstripe admin restrict</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20155</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17628&quot; title=&quot;add option to restrict lfs setstripe&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-17628&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-17628&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; only covers some code paths to file striping.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the same group access restrictions should also be applied to stripes set on directories, PFL, swap_layout, and direct to the xattr.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;we&apos;re using a similar patch with 2.15.8, but this patch is against main/master.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
