                            <comment id="493261" author="green" created="Fri, 17 Apr 2026 17:15:58 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Do you mean the current master codebase does not cover the code paths adequately? Or just in b2_15 branch?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you ar using a modified patch, consider uploading it to gerrit for review?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="493630" author="scadmin" created="Fri, 24 Apr 2026 03:42:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;the functionality to allow only a privileged group or users to use lfs setstripe, PFL, etc. is incomplete in master and b2_15.&lt;br/&gt;
currently there are multiple ways available to users to still set striping.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;the patch I made for master and b2_15 is basically the same.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(edit - concerns related to unrelated lbug removed)&lt;/p&gt;

